{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "925d35c7-426f-806a-9098-de78afc401bd",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T14:07:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I need a certified copy of my birth certificate. It's for a passport, so..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Were you born here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at the hospital here. Nineteen fifty-one. I just need the one copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, perfect. And it's your own record you're requesting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my own. Angela Mancini. That's my married name now, so the birth name is different, I'd have to give you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, we'll just need your name as it appears on the certificate. You can come in with a photo ID and fill out the request form, or we can send you the application if you'd rather do it by mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, what's the fee for a certified copy? I want to bring the right amount if I come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to quote you a wrong number off the top of my head. The fee is posted on the vital records page and it's also on the form. If you tell me your number I can have someone confirm it and call you back, or you can just ask at the counter when you get here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. The number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. And we're open weekdays during regular business hours, so you've got time today if you wanted to stop by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not today, I'm packing. We're going away for the weekend, just a little trip, and I can't decide on shoes. I keep putting the same two pairs in and taking them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I know that one. Which ones are you torn between?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The comfortable ones or the nice ones. I'll probably end up bringing both and... [pause] anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring both, that's my advice. Nobody ever regretted an extra pair of shoes. So, once you're back, come on in early next week with your ID and we'll get that copy made for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that sounds good. Would Tuesday be all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday's fine. You'd likely walk out with it the same visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you very much, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Mancini. Have a nice trip, and enjoy the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
